    "description": "Quest Alliance Capital India invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Curriculum Developer at our Lucknow location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Quest Alliance Capital India:\nQuest Alliance Capital India is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Conduct parent-teacher meetings and update parents on student performance\n• Monitor student progress and provide timely feedback\n• Maintain classroom discipline and create a positive learning environment\n• Create curriculum-aligned learning materials and assessments\n• Develop and deliver engaging lesson plans for students\n• Participate in school events, workshops, and training programs\n• Support students with special educational needs\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Data Analysis\n• Proficiency in LMS Platforms\n• Proficiency in Content Creation\n• Proficiency in Mentoring\n• Proficiency in Research Skills\n• Proficiency in Educational Technology\n• Proficiency in IB Curriculum\n• Proficiency in Student Assessment\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Quest Alliance Capital India!",
